# The vendored upstream dataset under data/external/ is raw scientific data and
# must round-trip byte-for-byte. Its CSVs are CRLF-terminated as published, and
# this repo sets core.autocrlf=true, which would otherwise rewrite the line
# endings on commit and checkout -- silently producing files that no longer
# match the published originals or their checksums.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion for these paths. Do not remove it.
data/external/** -text
